{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "def count_Substrings(s: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of substrings in a digit string where the sum of digits\n    equals the length of the substring.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    n = len(s)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_sum = 0\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            # Calculate the sum of digits for the current substring s[i:j+1]\n            current_sum += int(s[j])\n            \n            # The length of the current substring s[i:j+1] is (j - i + 1)\n            substring_length = j - i + 1\n            \n            # Check if the sum of digits equals the length\n            if current_sum == substring_length:\n                count += 1\n    return count"}
