{"task_id": "Mbpp/69", "solution": "def is_sublist(main_list: list, sub_list: list) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if 'sub_list' is a contiguous sub-sequence within 'main_list'.\n    Returns True if sub_list is found contiguously in main_list, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not sub_list:\n        return True\n    if not main_list and sub_list:\n        return False\n    if len(sub_list) > len(main_list):\n        return False\n\n    n = len(main_list)\n    m = len(sub_list)\n\n    for i in range(n - m + 1):\n        if main_list[i:i+m] == sub_list:\n            return True\n    return False"}
