{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "_memo = {1: 1, 2: 1}\n\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence using memoization.\n    P(1) = 1, P(2) = 1, P(n) = P(P(n - 1)) + P(n - P(n - 1)) for n > 2.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n in _memo:\n        return _memo[n]\n\n    # Calculate P(n) using the recurrence relation\n    pn_minus_1 = sequence(n - 1)\n    \n    result = sequence(pn_minus_1) + sequence(n - pn_minus_1)\n    _memo[n] = result\n    return result"}
