{"task_id": "Mbpp/131", "solution": "VOWELS = \"aeiouAEIOU\"\n\ndef reverse_vowels(s: str) -> str:\n    if not isinstance(s, str):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input must be a string.\")\n\n    s_list = list(s)\n    vowel_indices = []\n    vowels_found = []\n\n    for i, char in enumerate(s_list):\n        if char in VOWELS:\n            vowel_indices.append(i)\n            vowels_found.append(char)\n\n    vowels_found.reverse()\n\n    for i, original_index in enumerate(vowel_indices):\n        s_list[original_index] = vowels_found[i]\n\n    return \"\".join(s_list)"}
