{"task_id": "Mbpp/161", "solution": "def remove_elements(source_list: list, elements_to_remove: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Removes all elements from source_list that are present in elements_to_remove.\n    Returns a new list with the specified elements removed, preserving order.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not source_list:\n        return []\n    if not elements_to_remove:\n        return list(source_list)\n\n    elements_to_remove_set = set(elements_to_remove)\n    result = [item for item in source_list if item not in elements_to_remove_set]\n    return result"}
