{"task_id": "Mbpp/170", "solution": "from typing import List, Union\n\ndef sum_range_list(numbers: List[Union[int, float]], start_index: int, end_index: int) -> Union[int, float]:\n    \"\"\"Sums numbers in a list within a specified range (inclusive).\n    Returns 0 for an empty list or if the start_index is out of bounds.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not numbers or start_index >= len(numbers):\n        return 0\n\n    current_sum = 0\n    for i in range(start_index, end_index + 1):\n        current_sum += numbers[i]\n        \n    return current_sum"}
