{"task_id": "Mbpp/244", "solution": "def next_Perfect_Square(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the next perfect square strictly greater than the given number n.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n < 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    # Calculate the integer square root of n.\n    root = int(n**0.5)\n    \n    # The root of the next perfect square will be (root + 1).\n    next_root = root + 1\n    \n    return next_root * next_root"}
