{"task_id": "Mbpp/296", "solution": "def get_Inv_Count(arr):\n    \"\"\"Counts inversions in an array using a brute-force O(N^2) approach.\"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n    inv_count = 0\n    for i in range(n - 1):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if arr[i] > arr[j]:\n                inv_count += 1\n    return inv_count"}
