{"task_id": "Mbpp/395", "solution": "from collections import Counter\n\ndef first_non_repeating_character(s: str) -> str | None:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the first non-repeated character in a given string.\n    Returns the character or None if no non-repeated character is found.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not s:\n        return None\n\n    char_counts = Counter(s)\n\n    for char in s:\n        if char_counts[char] == 1:\n            return char\n    return None"}
