{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "def cal_sum(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of Perrin numbers from P(0) to P(n).\n    Uses memoization for efficient calculation of individual Perrin numbers.\n    \"\"\"\n    _memo = {0: 3, 1: 0, 2: 2}\n\n    def _calculate_perrin(k: int) -> int:\n        if k in _memo:\n            return _memo[k]\n\n        # P(k) = P(k-2) + P(k-3) for k > 2\n        result = _calculate_perrin(k - 2) + _calculate_perrin(k - 3)\n        _memo[k] = result\n        return result\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n + 1):\n        total_sum += _calculate_perrin(i)\n    return total_sum"}
