{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "import math\n\ndef sumofFactors(number):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all even factors of a given positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    factors = set()\n    # Find all factors by iterating up to the square root of the number.\n    for i in range(1, int(math.sqrt(number)) + 1):\n        if number % i == 0:\n            factors.add(i)\n            factors.add(number // i)\n\n    total_even_sum = 0\n    # Filter for even factors and sum them.\n    for factor in factors:\n        if factor % 2 == 0:\n            total_even_sum += factor\n            \n    return total_even_sum"}
