{"task_id": "Mbpp/471", "solution": "def find_remainder(arr: list[int], n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the product of all elements in an array modulo n.\n    Applies the modulo operation at each multiplication step to prevent overflow.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Modulo 'n' must be a positive integer.\")\n\n    if not arr:\n        return 1\n\n    product = 1\n    for element in arr:\n        product = (product * element) % n\n    return product"}
