{"task_id": "Mbpp/556", "solution": "def find_Odd_Pair(numbers: list[int], n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of pairs (a, b) in the input list such that a ^ b is odd.\n    A ^ B is odd if one number is odd and the other is even.\n    \"\"\"\n    odd_count = 0\n    even_count = 0\n\n    for num in numbers:\n        if num % 2 != 0:  # Check if odd\n            odd_count += 1\n        else:  # Check if even\n            even_count += 1\n            \n    return odd_count * even_count"}
