{"task_id": "Mbpp/558", "solution": "def digit_distance_nums(num1, num2):\n    str_num1 = str(num1)\n    str_num2 = str(num2)\n\n    max_len = max(len(str_num1), len(str_num2))\n\n    padded_str_num1 = str_num1.zfill(max_len)\n    padded_str_num2 = str_num2.zfill(max_len)\n\n    total_difference = 0\n    for i in range(max_len):\n        digit1 = int(padded_str_num1[i])\n        digit2 = int(padded_str_num2[i])\n        total_difference += abs(digit1 - digit2)\n\n    return total_difference"}
