{"task_id": "Mbpp/580", "solution": "def extract_even(data: tuple) -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Recursively traverses a nested tuple, extracts all even integer elements,\n    and returns a new tuple preserving the original nesting structure.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_elements = []\n    for item in data:\n        if isinstance(item, int):\n            if item % 2 == 0:\n                result_elements.append(item)\n        elif isinstance(item, tuple):\n            filtered_sub_tuple = extract_even(item)\n            if filtered_sub_tuple:\n                result_elements.append(filtered_sub_tuple)\n\n    return tuple(result_elements)"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/583", "solution": "class InvalidInputError(ValueError):\n    \"\"\"Custom exception for invalid input parameters.\"\"\"\n    def __init__(self, message: str):\n        super().__init__(message)\n        self.message = message\n\n_memo = {}\n\ndef get_memo() -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Returns the shared memoization dictionary.\"\"\"\n    return _memo\n\nclass CatalanCalculator:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates Catalan numbers using dynamic programming with memoization.\n    \"\"\"\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._memo = get_memo()\n\n    def calculate(self, n: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"\n        Computes the nth Catalan number.\n        \"\"\"\n        if n < 0:\n            raise InvalidInputError(\"n must be non-negative\")\n        if n == 0:\n            return 1\n        if n in self._memo:\n            return self._memo[n]\n\n        # C_n = sum(C_i * C_{n-1-i}) for i from 0 to n-1\n        res = 0\n        for i in range(n):\n            res += self.calculate(i) * self.calculate(n - 1 - i)\n        self._memo[n] = res\n        return res\n\ndef catalan_number(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns the nth Catalan number.\n    Raises InvalidInputError if n is negative.\n    \"\"\"\n    calculator = CatalanCalculator()\n    return calculator.calculate(n)"}
