{"task_id": "Mbpp/581", "solution": "def surface_Area(base_edge, height):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the surface area of a square pyramid using the formula:\n    SA = base_edge^2 + 2 * base_edge * height, as per the provided assertion.\n    \"\"\"\n    base_area = base_edge ** 2\n    lateral_area = 2 * base_edge * height\n    surface_area = base_area + lateral_area\n    return float(surface_area)"}
