{"task_id": "Mbpp/644", "solution": "def reverse_Array_Upto_K(arr, k):\n    \"\"\"\n    Reverses the elements of an array from the beginning up to position k (exclusive).\n    Returns a new list with the first k elements reversed, and the rest unchanged.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = list(arr)\n    \n    # Reverse the prefix elements from index 0 to k-1\n    left = 0\n    right = k - 1\n    while left < right:\n        result[left], result[right] = result[right], result[left]\n        left += 1\n        right -= 1\n            \n    return result"}
