{"task_id": "Mbpp/726", "solution": "def multiply_elements(input_tuple):\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns a tuple where the i-th element is the product of the i-th and (i+1)-th elements of the input tuple.\n    Returns an empty tuple if the input has fewer than two elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(input_tuple) < 2:\n        return ()\n\n    result = []\n    for i in range(len(input_tuple) - 1):\n        result.append(input_tuple[i] * input_tuple[i+1])\n\n    return tuple(result)"}
