{"task_id": "Mbpp/733", "solution": "def find_first_occurrence(array: list[int], target: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the index of the first occurrence of a given number in a sorted array using binary search.\n    Returns -1 if the target is not found.\n    \"\"\"\n    left, right = 0, len(array) - 1\n    first_occurrence_index = -1\n\n    while left <= right:\n        mid = left + (right - left) // 2\n        if array[mid] == target:\n            first_occurrence_index = mid\n            right = mid - 1  # Try to find an earlier occurrence in the left half\n        elif array[mid] < target:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:  # array[mid] > target\n            right = mid - 1\n    return first_occurrence_index"}
