{"task_id": "Mbpp/740", "solution": "class InvalidTupleError(ValueError):\n    \"\"\"Custom exception raised when a tuple has an invalid length for conversion.\"\"\"\n    pass\n\ndef tuple_to_dict(data_tuple: tuple) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    Converts a tuple into a dictionary where adjacent elements form key-value pairs.\n    Raises InvalidTupleError if the input tuple has an odd number of elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(data_tuple) % 2 != 0:\n        raise InvalidTupleError(\"Tuple length must be even to form key-value pairs.\")\n\n    result_dict = {}\n    for i in range(0, len(data_tuple), 2):\n        key = data_tuple[i]\n        value = data_tuple[i+1]\n        result_dict[key] = value\n    return result_dict"}
