{"task_id": "Mbpp/765", "solution": "def find_nth_polite_number(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the nth polite number. A polite number is a positive integer that is not a power of 2.\n    \"\"\"\n    polite_count = 0\n    current_num = 1\n\n    while True:\n        # A number x is a power of two if x > 0 and (x & (x - 1)) == 0.\n        # We are looking for numbers that are NOT powers of two.\n        if not (current_num > 0 and (current_num & (current_num - 1)) == 0):\n            polite_count += 1\n            if polite_count == n:\n                return current_num\n        current_num += 1"}
