{"task_id": "Mbpp/767", "solution": "def get_pairs_count(numbers: list[int], sum: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of pairs of distinct elements in the numbers list\n    whose sum equals the target 'sum'.\n    \"\"\"\n    pair_count = 0\n    n = len(numbers)\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if numbers[i] + numbers[j] == sum:\n                pair_count += 1\n    return pair_count"}
